. * EXTRACT AND EXPORT RESULTS * (Please check whether the suggested code autom
> atically picks up the correct statistics for your chosen regression analysis 
> and adapt if needed)
. 
. * Extract statistics
. local coefficient = _b[interaction_F_D]

. local se = _se[interaction_F_D]

. local test_stat_family "t"

. local df_residual = e(df_r)

. local df_model = e(df_m)

. local tstat = _b[interaction_F_D]/_se[interaction_F_D]

. local p_value = 2*ttail(e(df_r), abs(`tstat'))

. local num_obs = e(N)

. 
. * Number of participants (assuming 'pid' is participant ID)
. quietly levelsof pid if e(sample), local(participants)

. local num_participants : word count `participants'

. 
. * Interpretation of directionality
. local interpretation = "negative coefficient is in line with hypothesis"

. 
